# The SQLite database file is created automatically on first run,
# so it should not be stored in Git.
app.db

# Course slides, notes and the planning brief. They are for us to read,
# not part of the app's code, so Git should not track them.
*.pdf
brief.md

# Uploaded profile photos (feature 07). On a laptop they are saved in
# photos/ next to app.db; like the database, they are not stored in Git.
photos/
